questions.solution:
Block $B$ will come to rest, if force applied to it will vanish due to frictional force acting between block $B$ and surface, $i e$, force applied $=$ frictional force
ie, $\quad \mu m g=m a$ or $\begin{aligned}
\mu m g & =m\left(\frac{v}{t}\right) \\
t & =\frac{v}{\mu g}
\end{aligned}$

